[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0264","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0264.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0695","title":"Sybase PowerDynamo 路径穿越任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Sybase PowerDynamo 个人 Web 服务器存在路径遍历漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过 URL 中的 ../ 序列绕过访问限制，远程读取服务器文件系统上的任意文件（如 /etc/passwd 等敏感文件），导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响系统机密性，攻击复杂度低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0695"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-04-11T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"Sybase PowerDynamo 已停止维护，建议立即迁移至 SAP 官方推荐的替代产品（如 SAP ASE Web 服务或迁移至现代 Web 服务器）。如无法迁移，在 Web 服务器层面配置 URL 重写规则拦截包含 .. 的请求路径，并限制 Web 服务进程对系统敏感文件的读取权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1064","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/620"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0264.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0525","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0525.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0790","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":16272,\"outputTokens\":34,\"totalTokens\":16306}}","description":"Netscape 浏览器存在缓存信息泄露漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在网页中嵌入恶意 JavaScript 代码，利用浏览器同源策略的不足读取目标用户缓存中的敏感数据。由于 Netscape 浏览器（ Communicator 系列）的缓存机制缺乏对 JavaScript 访问的适当限制，攻击者可在用户不知情的情况下，通过构造特定脚本触发缓存查询并获取信息。该漏洞影响 Netscape Communicator 4.x 等版本，攻击条件要求用户在浏览恶意页面时目标缓存中存在相关数据，CVSS 评分 2.6，危害等级低。Netscape 官方已发布安全公告建议用户升级至修复版本。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0790"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-04-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:03Z","remediation":"升级 Netscape Communicator 至 4.5 或更高版本以修复此漏洞，Netscape 官方已在安全公告中提供补丁。如无法立即升级，可在浏览器安全设置中禁用 JavaScript 作为临时缓解措施，阻止恶意脚本访问缓存数据。建议优先通过 Netscape 官网获取最新安全版本，并清除现有浏览器缓存以防止已缓存的敏感信息被读取。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://home.netscape.com/security/notes/jscachebrowsing.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e2d7ee098b36909e6f1960d9a77b8043812c482f/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0790.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0790","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0790.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2301e36f8af0694b1f220afdc97e9e07ee9e6a52/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0790.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f61040ac78eb76aff0a3a68a8a8a4562940d3711/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mvw7-68fw-g45r/GHSA-mvw7-68fw-g45r.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0790.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--55a0b034-c223-4289-b30c-2a9571d15929.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/47100ba13b280d8b2c20065cb4252225c6015d54/1999.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--55a0b034-c223-4289-b30c-2a9571d15929.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0525.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0262","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0262.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0693","title":"Digital UNIX、AIX、CDE、IRIX、Solaris、SunOS ToolTalk 共享库 TT_SESSION 环境变量本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"tags.<value>ToolTalk 共享库在处理 TT_SESSION 环境变量时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过精心构造该环境变量的内容，触发堆栈缓冲区溢出，进而实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响多个 Unix 系统版本，包括 DIGITAL UNIX 4.0、AIX 4.3.2、CDE 2.1、IRIX 6.5.14、Solaris 7.0 及 SunOS 4.1.4。成功利用该漏洞后，本地低权限用户可获得 root 权限，完全控制系统。攻击条件为攻击者已拥有目标系统的本地访问权限。CVSS 评分为 7.2，危害等级为高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0693"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-03-02T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:51Z","remediation":"建议立即安装各厂商针对此漏洞发布的安全补丁：Solaris 应用 Sun 的 ToolTalk 补丁（如 105396 系列），IRIX 升级至 6.5.15 或应用 SGI 的补丁，AIX 安装 APAR 修复并升级至 4.3.3，DIGITAL UNIX 应用 OSF/1 补丁集。在无法立即打补丁前，可通过删除或限制 /usr/dt/lib/libtt* 共享库及 setuid 程序的写执行权限、对普通用户移除 CDE/ToolTalk 相关 setuid 二进制文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/192","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/641","http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBUX9909-103","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A4374","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19501","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e2e66cc19cc703324c2947fd6e7687a8b094f9fa/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0693.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0693","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0693.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0f6f0e28732bc614273e91613aef04def1dce90b/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0693.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c137f5e2e6bb5d0d49e919ecf3efde0b10d9a781/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wjxh-cxm3-22mj/GHSA-wjxh-cxm3-22mj.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0693.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0262.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0173","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0173.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0595","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9117,\"outputTokens\":22,\"totalTokens\":10803}}","description":"Windows NT 与 Windows 2000 系统在关机时未对系统页面文件（pagefile.sys）进行安全擦除，导致其中缓存的密码、密钥、文档等敏感数据以明文形式残留在磁盘上。该漏洞影响所有运行上述系统的主机，攻击者需具备本地物理或逻辑访问权限，在系统关机后读取或挂载硬盘，通过分析残留的页面文件提取敏感信息，从而造成信息泄露。此问题属于配置与数据处理缺陷，危害相对有限但可能造成凭据泄露。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0595"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-01-20T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:42Z","remediation":"请安装 Windows NT 4.0 SP6a 或 Windows 2000 SP2 及以上官方补丁包（含 KB265117 等安全更新）彻底修复页面文件残留漏洞。若无法立即打补丁，请通过组策略“计算机配置→Windows设置→安全设置→本地策略→安全选项→关机: 清除虚拟内存页面文件”启用页面文件清零功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-17T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/216","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8cc4bd87e08227d0a597e9249036a66efd1a35dd/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0595.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0595","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/e046e4965f64348bd29a0c62edd023b3c580939e/content/CVE-1999-0595.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5bae259b1f96bb239cbfd83cd9b28dd6d9df406/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0595.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2e86ccb45bad26f6ff984e676f6d08b925d0e6ee/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-79qg-vhxm-8q4c/GHSA-79qg-vhxm-8q4c.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0595.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001110.txt","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/mega-foss/blob/4829eeb7b0101570abbc87d2a697f2c0c2f4e5c3/src/cve/graphql/trial.json","https://github.com/RiskBasedPrioritization/RiskBasedPrioritizationAnalysis/blob/3d5cc1819ecb8cbc3aeb75d9a8260318544faf56/data_in/acme/acme_cves.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0173.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1609","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1609.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0992","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":10781,\"outputTokens\":21,\"totalTokens\":10802}}","description":"HP VirtualVault 安全绕过漏洞，攻击者可利用受信任网关代理（TGP）机制 bypassing 补丁 PHSS_17692 限制，对系统发起非授权访问。该漏洞源于虚拟存储系统身份验证机制缺陷，允许任意未授权进程绕过访问控制，对文件进行非法读写或进行系统操作。攻击者无需具备管理员权限，只需向虚拟存储服务发送特定协议命令，即可取得对安全敏感数据的访问权限，导致企业敏感信息泄露、篡改或被恶意利用。HP 早前曾发布安全补丁，但实际应用中仍存在配置缺陷导致漏洞无法彻底修复，影响范围涵盖 Windows/Linux 多平台虚拟存储环境。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0992"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-01-18T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:28Z","remediation":"升级 HP VirtualVault 至包含 PHSS_17692 之后修复补丁的版本（如 PHSS_18500 及以上），并通过 Software Distributor 重新安装 TGP 模块。临时缓解：在 Trusted Gateway Proxy 配置中收紧进程访问控制列表，禁止未授权进程建立 TGP 连接，并限制仅允许受信虚拟主体访问代理端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBUX9912-107","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d69ab21f83909859ed75ab8ba3287f9f633b856f/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0992.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0992","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-0992.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c9ec7f26a52f816468b636e23146049097db5070/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0992.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f43f79d7ee652229af6058b1c98133bb5bbc17fb/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4c74-52ch-5mh5/GHSA-4c74-52ch-5mh5.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0992.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152000_152100.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001105.txt","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1609.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1609.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0839","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0839.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1002","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":10768,\"outputTokens\":17,\"totalTokens\":10785}}","description":"Netscape Navigator 在存储用户用于访问 Netscape 邮件服务的密码时，采用了强度较弱的加密算法进行保护。由于加密强度不足，本地或具备一定权限的攻击者可通过分析相关存储文件，较容易地还原出明文密码。该漏洞影响使用 Netscape Navigator 邮件功能的用户，攻击条件为攻击者需能访问受害者本地存储的密码数据或取得相应读取权限，利用方式为通过逆向弱加密存储内容获取邮件账户凭据，进而可能危及用户邮件通信安全。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1002"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-01-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:29Z","remediation":"建议将 Netscape Navigator 升级至 4.7 或更高版本（该版本改进了密码存储加密强度）。如无法立即升级，可在邮件客户端中取消\"记住密码\"选项，改用手动输入，并避免在不信任主机上保存邮件密码；同时在本地系统中对用户配置目录设置严格的文件访问权限以限制密码文件被读取。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94536309217214&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94570673523998&w=2","http://www.rstcorp.com/news/bad-crypto.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/786262dea273b0bddfc7eb6f6950f11b9f01c05c/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1002.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1002","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1002.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/165075bb4c3675993ac058501ff8575bd07a9ca0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1002.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/424512debdca84cc53ffa1fb3810a74f7b1905a5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wf2x-w2q8-7723/GHSA-wf2x-w2q8-7723.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1002.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152000_152100.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88419/info.html","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--d48d045b-59cc-4474-90a9-e6ede9ca2247.owl","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/63d4031680b3d3fa77b826660a1e30ffc70ff5cd/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1002.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0839.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1198","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1198.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0894","title":"Red Hat Linux screen 程序本地终端写入漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 系统中的 screen 终端复用器程序未正确使用 Unix98 伪终端（pty）机制，默认使用传统 BSD ptty，导致本地用户可向其他用户终端写入任意数据或执行命令，造成终端劫持、输入捕获或权限提升。攻击者只需拥有本地系统账号即可利用此漏洞，影响 Red Hat Linux 多个发行版本。厂商已发布安全更新修复该问题。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0894"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2000-01-04T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:16Z","remediation":"升级 screen 程序至 3.7.6 及以上版本（该版本开始默认启用 Unix98 pty 支持），或安装 Red Hat 提供的对应内核安全更新。如无法升级，可在 screen 配置文件中设置 `termcap` 限制非特权用户的窗口写入权限，或改用 tmux 等默认使用 Unix98 pty 的终端复用器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0894","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/1999/CVE-1999-0894.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0894.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0894","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0894.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0894.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gc92-56cg-2qv2/GHSA-gc92-56cg-2qv2.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0894.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001076.txt","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-1999-0894.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1198.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1106","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1106.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0876","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 4.0 在处理 EMBED 标签时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可构造包含恶意 EMBED 标签的特制网页，诱使用户访问后触发缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Windows 平台上的 Internet Explorer 4.0 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击者可通过电子邮件或恶意网站传播利用代码，无需身份认证即可完全控制目标系统。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0876"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-01-04T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:14Z","remediation":"立即升级 Internet Explorer 至 5.01 及以上版本，或安装 Microsoft 安全更新 MS99-037。鉴于 IE 4.0 已停止技术支持，建议升级至 IE 11 或改用 Edge/Chrome 等现代浏览器，同时在 IE 中禁用 ActiveX 控件及 EMBED 标签解析功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ185959","http://support.microsoft.com/support/kb/articles/q176/6/97.asp","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/638563f1ec085a412c2e42f3935801ae34f0dfd9/1999/CVE-1999-0876.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a5db9ce197a4914a8237308d958cd159d8832fe6/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0876.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0876","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/21d84550d4f5d6b78cac9f7c41b1b20a874c9f15/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0876.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0876.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d94ad47d0f2016e121b6d251f490e890714f8916/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pfw2-q2vc-hgpf/GHSA-pfw2-q2vc-hgpf.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152000_152100.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/134977c5f4ce4f427a914ca161b4f075e34b560b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0876.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1106.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0350","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0350.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0735","title":"KDE K-Mail 临时目录符号链接攻击本地权限提升漏洞","description":"KDE K-Mail 存在符号链接攻击漏洞，本地攻击者可在用户临时目录中预创建恶意符号链接，当 K-Mail 在处理临时文件时将会跟随符号链接覆盖或创建任意系统文件，从而导致权限提升。该漏洞影响 KDE 1.1/1.1.1、RedHat Linux 6.0、Caldera OpenLinux 等系统，攻击者需拥有本地账号权限方可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0735"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-01-04T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:56Z","remediation":"升级 KDE 至 1.1.2 及以上版本，或升级操作系统至现代发行版。K-Mail 在临时目录中使用可预测文件名创建文件，攻击者可通过符号链接攻击劫持文件操作。如无法升级，确保 umask 设置为 077 并限制本地用户对 /tmp 的写权限作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA1999015_01.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/300","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19240","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/56b9e9b42ce0a91a448094549973b81cdf8e832e/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0735.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0735","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-1999-0735.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/61756b9c4d4c30577cc003b0b28e3db71ca30a1e/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0735.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6q2m-wvf7-77h8/GHSA-6q2m-wvf7-77h8.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0735.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt","https://github.com/VulnerabilityHistoryProject/mega-foss/blob/4829eeb7b0101570abbc87d2a697f2c0c2f4e5c3/src/cve/graphql/trial.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0350.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0350.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0350.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0894","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0894.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0894","title":"Red Hat Linux screen 程序未使用 Unix98 ptys 漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 系统中的 screen 终端复用程序未正确使用 Unix98 伪终端（ptys）设备，导致本地攻击者可以向其他用户的终端会话写入数据，进而可能执行任意命令或窃取敏感信息。攻击者需要拥有本地系统账户权限才能利用此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0894"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-01-04T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Red Hat Linux 系统中的 screen 程序至支持 Unix98 ptty 的修补版本，并限制非授权用户的本地终端访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T10:51:44Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0894","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0894"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0894.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0365","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0365.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0744","title":"Netscape Enterprise Server 与 FastTrack Server 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Netscape Enterprise Server 及 FastTrack Server 中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过发送超长的 HTTP GET 请求触发溢出，从而在服务器上执行任意代码并提升权限。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击门槛低，成功利用后可导致服务器被完全控制、敏感信息泄露及服务中断。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0744"],"sources":["cve","epss"],"published":"2000-01-04T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Netscape Enterprise Server 与 FastTrack Server 至厂商发布的已修复版本，在补丁部署前可通过反向代理或 WAF 限制过长的 HTTP GET 请求长度，并对 HTTP 请求头字段做长度校验以缓解溢出风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T02:21:21Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0744","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/603"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0365.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0365.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0365.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0756","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0756.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0964","title":"FreeBSD libc setlocale 函数 PATH_LOCALE 环境变量缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"FreeBSD 系统的 libc 库中 setlocale 函数在处理 PATH_LOCALE 环境变量时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过构造超长的 PATH_LOCALE 环境变量值，导致堆栈缓冲区溢出，进而执行任意代码获得 root 权限。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 3.x 早期版本，攻击条件为攻击者拥有本地登录权限或能通过其他方式在目标系统上执行程序并控制其环境变量。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0964"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:25Z","remediation":"立即升级至 FreeBSD 3.4-RELEASE 或更高版本（包括 FreeBSD-SA-00:19 补丁），该补丁修复了 libc 中 setlocale 函数处理 PATH_LOCALE 环境变量时的缓冲区溢出问题。如无法立即升级，可在系统环境变量配置中移除 PATH_LOCALE 变量，或修改启动脚本使用支持边界检查的 locale 设置方式，同时建议检查是否有未授权账户登录痕迹。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/6086","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/20b9340dcaffca733259fb153ac741206a5bbc5f/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0964.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0964","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0964.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e90735e3e31fc62018265dfbae313d166e653462/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0964.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d9ad03f9df46533ce9229f9da6bbf66bd77a3f4f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9w6w-73wp-668p/GHSA-9w6w-73wp-668p.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0964.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83054/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152000_152100.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/233cd9746ce3c3e9d47fe0335940ddf03b9a0845/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0756.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-2106","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-2106.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1591","title":"Microsoft Internet Information Services 身份认证绕过漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Information Services (IIS) 4.0 SP4 在未安装特定安全修补程序的情况下，存在认证绕过漏洞。由于特定条件下服务器未正确验证用户身份凭据，远程攻击者可通过 Microsoft Visual InterDev 6.0 等客户端工具直接访问受保护的资源，无需提供有效认证信息。该漏洞影响 IIS 4.0 及早期版本，攻击者利用此漏洞可绕过身份验证机制，获取受限目录或文件的未授权访问权限，进而可能进一步探测系统敏感信息。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1591"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:47Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响已停止支持的 Microsoft IIS 4.0 SP4（Windows NT 4.0 Option Pack）。根本修复方案是升级操作系统至 Windows Server 2019/2022 及以上版本，使用 IIS 10.0 或更新版本。如无法升级，应安装当年发布的 SP4 安全修补程序（Hotfix），同时在 IIS 管理器中禁用未使用的身份验证方法，并限制通过 Visual InterDev 6.0 的远程管理连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/1998-1999/msg00276.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/1998-1999/msg00277.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/190","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c729733510a7fb9b2cb302c6d8fbcecf1fc7ba0f/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1591.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1591","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1591.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2cd9d7030fbc42684ccfa32eb6cd959ffcadf351/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1591.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x4j4-xc7j-8rv5/GHSA-x4j4-xc7j-8rv5.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1591.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001066.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--9e271b07-d6b2-41cf-9e3c-457a18fff72f.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/CERTCC/SBOM/blob/ae581e32992458f65018df4eced684b7370bba39/SwiftBOM/cpe_lookup/cve_lookup/microsoft/visual_interdev_cve.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-2106.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-2100","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-2100.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1588","title":"Sun Solaris x86 nlps_server 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Sun Solaris x86 2.4、2.5 及 2.5.1 版本的 nlps_server 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，可通过向监听端口（TCP 2766）发送特制的以 \"NLPS:002:002:\" 开头超长字符串触发该漏洞，导致以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Solaris x86 系列操作系统，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1588"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:46Z","remediation":"立即升级至受支持的 Oracle Solaris 11 或更高版本，该漏洞在后续版本中已修复；如无法升级，禁用 nlps_server 服务（执行 `/etc/init.d/nlps_server stop` 并移除以 S 开头的启动链接），同时在防火墙层面封锁 TCP 端口 2766 阻止外部访问监听端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lsd-pl.net/files/get?SOLARIS/solx86_nlps_server","http://security-protocols.com/sploits/unsorted_exploits/nlps_server.c","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2319","http://www.securityfocus.com/data/vulnerabilities/exploits/nlps_server.c","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20602","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/1999/CVE-1999-1588.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c729733510a7fb9b2cb302c6d8fbcecf1fc7ba0f/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1588.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1588","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/b49e13cf2d645af804096640daf5e00cefbce237/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1588.json","https://github.com/krafthack-by-techday/Night-s-watch/blob/30ae1bcc335306fe4c5507b2c629cae4932e515e/cve/nvd/CVE-1999-1588_90f8dcbd-6e6a-43b1-ab5b-2370d6ed9641","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1588.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wh9q-9hjg-qw4c/GHSA-wh9q-9hjg-qw4c.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2cd9d7030fbc42684ccfa32eb6cd959ffcadf351/SSVC/data/1999/CVE-1999-1588.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001063.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--01db8430-9ac8-47b1-8615-8a9920ff0d0a.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-2100.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-2009","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-2009.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1584","title":"Sun SunOS loadmodule 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"SunOS 4.1.1 至 4.1.3c 版本及 Open Windows 3.0 系统中，loadmodule 和 modload 程序在设置 setuid/setgid 权限时存在不安全的环境变量处理漏洞。本地攻击者可通过精心构造特定的环境变量，利用这些程序的特权提升漏洞获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 SunOS 系列操作系统，无需用户交互即可被本地利用，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1584"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:46Z","remediation":"升级到 SunOS 4.1.4 及以上版本，或迁移至 Solaris 2.x (SunOS 5.x) 系列。如无法升级，移除 loadmodule 和 modload 的 setuid/setgid 权限：`chmod u-s /usr/bin/loadmodule` 和 `chmod g-s /usr/bin/modload`。同时检查并清除环境变量中的恶意 PATH/IFS 设置作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-22-00124-1","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-1993-18.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/aac9f724534c8b70ef764b55a2e686a2db6290f7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1584.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1584","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1584.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2cd9d7030fbc42684ccfa32eb6cd959ffcadf351/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1584.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/23c72f0e29729596bf60b6750cbec12b936da4bf/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8jjf-pj37-wq93/GHSA-8jjf-pj37-wq93.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0282.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/spe